librepo
------------------------------------------
A library providing C and Python (libcURL like) API for downloading linux
repository metadata and packages

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libgpgme45-2.2.0-1
  librepo-devel-1.21.2-1bl1
  librepo0-1.21.2-1bl1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libxml2-2.13.9-2
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-2
  libzck-devel-1.5.4-1bl1
  libzck1-1.5.4-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1
  python3-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  check-0.15.2-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libgpgme-devel-2.2.0-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-2
  libzck-devel-1.5.4-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/rpm-software-management/librepo/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/rpm-software-management/librepo/archive/refs/tags/1.21.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack librepo-1.21.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./librepo-1.21.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/librepo-1.21.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/librepo-1.21.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/librepo0-1.21.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/librepo-devel-1.21.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-librepo-1.21.2-X.tar.xz

